M Top — Hip Hop — Gangstarap","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":79,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":118267099057662,"name":"AOTY Must Hear 1990s","src":"musthear","grp":null,"list_year":null,"rank":83,"year":null,"note":null,"total":432,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":198433558933938,"name":"This album is the BEST in its GENRE @Frenchblues","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":208,"year":null,"note":null,"total":730,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":36565743209502,"name":"Rolling Stone 500 Greatest Albums Of All Time 2023 Edition","src":"musthear","grp":null,"list_year":null,"rank":383,"year":null,"note":null,"total":500,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","src":"charts","grp":"Scaruffi","list_year":null,"rank":909,"year":1998,"note":null,"total":1406,"scaruffi":7.0}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"Celebrating its 20th anniversary, this album is highlighted as one of the most important records of the 90s. It is seen as the work that best crystallizes and culminates the fusion movement that Trip Hop became, bringing together all the influences the genre incorporated over the years. It marks a point of inflection for Trip Hop, after which the genre became very diffuse and complex. This album is noted for its emotional intensity, with moments described as \"penetrant,\" and incorporates influences from classic American soul, deep downtempo rhythmic bases of Trip Hop, Björk's more melodic and intimate Trip Hop, synthesizers, new wave, and classical electronic music. Critically, it is considered by many to be Massive Attack's best work. \"posiblemente esté disco del 98 al mesanín de Masi Batak. Si el disco que mejora, glutina, mejor, culmina, es ese movimiento de fusión que fue el Trip Hop.\"","year":1998,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"MASSIVE ATTACK. 20 años de MEZZANINE","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wG6NEzM5CEQ"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"Massive Attack released a special edition of their *Mezzanine* album, which came in a can of spray paint. This unique format contained audio that was encoded in DNA. \"It came in a can of spray paint containing audio that was encoded in DNA.\"","year":1998,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"60 Mind Blowing Facts in 60 Minutes: The 5th Edition","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=72Lei7uug8c"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"Released in 1998, this album was a product of intense internal discord within the band, where they veered towards a darker, more industrial, and aggressive sound. It is possibly their most known album, uniquely capturing the sense of technological alienation felt at the close of the millennium. \"El resultado de este discicio fue Mesa Nín, posiblemente el álbum más conocido de la banda donde dieron un giro a la oscuridad.\"","year":1998,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"El género más OSCURO de los 90 (...que acabó en anuncios de coches)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9gAEaRBEw9c"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"This 1998 album featured the song \"Teardrop.\" \"Massive Attack and Teardrop from their 1998 album Misanine.\"","year":1998,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The 90s Part 5b: Hip-Hop's Effects Part 2","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5bQz8R0gbXc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"This 1998 album is highlighted as a personal favorite among Massive Attack's \"long list of excellent records\" and features the song \"Angel.\" \"My personal favorite is Mezzanine from 1998, which features this song called Angel.\"","year":1998,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Black History Month 2023","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_1NNvxgx8uA"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"20th Anniversary Album","body":"Celebrating its 20th anniver